<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TELJOY ISSUES FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</title>
<headline>TELJOY ISSUES FURTHER CAUTIONARY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teljoy Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that, further to announcements in February and March, the unbundling process of parent company Servgro as it effects Teljoy has not been finalised.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to continue exercising caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
